l21: $ G , ∃ x1 (f = ⟨ kc_srt , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x1) ⇒ ∃ x1 (f = ⟨ kc_srt , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x1) $ by ax
l22: $ G , ∃ x1 (f = ⟨ kc_srt , scons x1 ∅ ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x1) ⇒ k = e2_N0 ∧ l = e2_L $ by ex_elim [l21, l20]
l23: $ G , f = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel ⇒ f = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel $ by ax
