l28: $ G , f = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel ⇒ ⊥ $ by e2_srt_pi [l27]
l29: $ G , f = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel ⇒ k = e2_N0 ∧ l = e2_L $ by bot_elim [l28]
