l32: $ G , ∃ x4 ∃ x1 (f = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x4 ∃ x1 (f = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
l33: $ G , ∃ x4 ∃ x1 (f = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel) ⇒ k = e2_N0 ∧ l = e2_L $ by ex_elim [l32, l31]
