l36: $ G , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x1 (f = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x1 (f = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ l = x1 ∧ ra_isort x3 x4 x1 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
