Aw9: $ G , c = ∅ ∧ k = tn_K0 ⇒ z = ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ $ by weaken [#9]
A1: $ G , c = ∅ ∧ k = tn_K0 ⇒ c = ∅ $ by and_elim_l [A0]
A2: $ G , c = ∅ ∧ k = tn_K0 ⇒ k = tn_K0 $ by and_elim_r [A0]
A3a: $ G , c = ∅ ∧ k = tn_K0 ⇒ fv (etf u (dnf u M)) k = fv (etf u (dnf u M)) tn_K0 $ by fv_eq [Aw18, A2]
A3: $ G , c = ∅ ∧ k = tn_K0 ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) k w (scat p (ixs tr_nat_D w Z)) = etel u (dnf u M) tn_K0 w (ixs tr_nat_D w Z) $ by da_eq [A3a, Aw4, Aw13]
A4: $ G , c = ∅ ∧ k = tn_K0 ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) tn_K0 w (ixs tr_nat_D w Z) = csn ept0 $ by nat_etel_K0 [Aw17, Aw10]
A5: $ G , c = ∅ ∧ k = tn_K0 ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) k w (scat p (ixs tr_nat_D w Z)) = csn ept0 $ by eq_trans [A3, A4]
A6: $ G , c = ∅ ∧ k = tn_K0 ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ csn ept0 $ by wcel_eq_r [A5, Aw8]
A7: $ G , c = ∅ ∧ k = tn_K0 ⇒ f = ∅ ∧ g = ∅ ∧ t = ∅ ∧ a = ∅ $ by ept0_elim [A6]
A7a: $ G , c = ∅ ∧ k = tn_K0 ⇒ g = ∅ ∧ t = ∅ ∧ a = ∅ $ by and_elim_r [A7]
