A10: $ G , c = ∅ ∧ k = tn_K0 ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , nzr ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [Aw15, A9]
A11: $ G , c = ∅ ∧ k = tn_K0 ⇒ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , nzr ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [Aw9, A10]
