k7c: $ G , q ∊ {z | ∃ b ∃ c ∃ e (⟨ z , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ fv tt d)} , ⟨ q , ⟨ b , ⟨ c , e ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ fv tt d ⇒ ap L ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ e , apn (fv gg d) q ⟩ ⟩ = ap L ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , x ⟩ ⟩ $ by ap_eq [k7l, k7b]
