r9b: $ ∀ x8 (⟨ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , y1 ⟩ ⟩ , x8 ⟩ ∈ ifold u (dnf u M) tr_nat_D w ∅ (scons ms (scons z ∅)) ↔ x8 = b0) ⟺ ∀ o (⟨ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , y1 ⟩ ⟩ , o ⟩ ∈ ifold u (dnf u M) tr_nat_D w ∅ (scons ms (scons z ∅)) ↔ o = b0) $ by all_alpha
